wledgement, changed boot identity corroborated by lifecycle snapshots, and recovered services, data, security state, and SMB workflow.","limitations":["Credential values were appropriately redacted, so the exact password cannot be independently inspected; evidence nevertheless shows the commands read access.txt and then authenticated successfully from node2.","The first node1 post-restart client recovery script exited nonzero because of its deletion-check logic, although its output directly shows successful read, write, and read-back operations; subsequent evidence confirmed cleanup and a fully healthy end-to-end workflow.","Lifecycle snapshots provide bounded inventories rather than complete filesystem and configuration captures; detailed task-specific commands supply the remaining direct evidence."]}
